    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1 無故曠課３次，平時成績以０分計</div>\n\n<div>2 期中、期末報告 可1人報告，也可2~3人一組報告</div>\n\n<div>3 期中、期末成績= 50%口頭報告+50%個人報告回饋單</div>\n\n<div>4 若使用AI輔助，請註明使用項目，例如:使用AI修正文句、使用AI製作插圖。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "以下是提醒學生的條列事項：\n\n準時上課：請確保按時到達教室。\n缺席規定：超過10分鐘才到課將會計入缺席。\n課間離席：課間離席超過10分鐘也會計入缺席。\n參與討論：請認真參與活動和討論，積極發言。\n作業繳交：務必準時繳交作業與報告。\n使用AI：合理使用AI工具，輔助學習而非取代學習。\n\nHere are reminders for students:\n\nBe On Time: Please make sure to arrive on time for class.\nAbsence Policy: Arriving more than 10 minutes late will count as an absence.\nLeaving During Break: Leaving for more than 10 minutes during breaks will also count as an absence.\nParticipate in Discussions: Please actively participate in activities and discussions.\nSubmit Assignments: Make sure to submit assignments and reports on time.\nUse AI Wisely: Use AI tools reasonably to assist your learning, not to replace it.",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>學術誠信是學習的基石，學生必須明白，合理使用AI工具可以輔助學習，但絕不能取代自己的思考與努力。AI能提供資訊和建議，但最終的理解和應用仍需依賴自身的學習過程。保持學術誠信不僅能提升個人能力，還能培養正確的價值觀，為未來的學術與職業生涯打下堅實的基礎。讓我們共同努力，善用科技，促進真正的學習與成長。<br />\n<br />\nAcademic integrity is the foundation of learning. Students must understand that using AI tools can help with learning, but they should not replace their own thinking and effort. AI can provide information and suggestions, but true understanding and application still rely on personal learning. Maintaining academic integrity not only enhances individual skills but also fosters the right values, laying a solid foundation for future academic and career success. Let&rsquo;s work together to use technology wisely and promote genuine learning and growth.</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "Y"
  },
